      "text": "[11:03PM] #Ijanikin #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood vehicular movement from Abule-Ado to Iyana Iba, encompassing Ojo Barracks, Agric, Volkswagen, Afolabi Ege Fruits market.\nUnencumbered traffic flow from Alaba Rago to Custom Checkpoint Ijanikin, covering Okokomaiko, Iyana Isashi, and Iyana Era.\nSmooth and swift movement from Iyana Iba intersection to Obadore Bridge, passing through Techno U-turn, First Gate, Ipaye, and Iyana School.\n\nGood traffic flow on the return journey from Obadore Bridge back to Iyana Iba.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
